本仓库不包含模型权重。底座模型由 prism-ml 以 Apache-2.0 发布，推理引擎来自
PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp（MIT）。附带的方向适配器遵循 Apache-2.0。

The model weights are not distributed here. The base model is published by
prism-ml under Apache-2.0; the inference engine is PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp (MIT);
the bundled direction adapter follows Apache-2.0.
